  "note": "The only list of versions the kit trusts. install/install.ps1, install/install.sh and `fk setup` install exactly these; tests/setup.test.mjs fails when a script drifts from this file. min = below this is red; version = the tested pin (older but >= min is yellow, newer is kept). exact = both install scripts install exactly this version (or commit); git, node and gh come from the OS package manager at its current release, checked against min.",
